; post-exile prophets; not Chronicles — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> usually of non-Hebrew peoples <ref ref=\"Exod 9:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,24)\">Exod 9:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,10)\">Exod 34:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Lev 25:44\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,44)\">Lev 25:44</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Num 14:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,14,15)\">Num 14:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Deut 15:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,6)\">Deut 15:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,11)\">1Kgs 5:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,17)\">1Chr 14:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,20)\">1Chr 16:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,10)\">Isa 11:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,12)\">Isa 11:12</ref> + often; opposed to Israel as <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עם י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,23)\">2Sam 7:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,21)\">1Chr 17:21</ref> (twice in verse) etc., see <bdbheb>עם</bdbheb>, compare